This workspace is the konashevich fork of QymCAD, not a clean upstream tree.

- Root `AGENTS.md` is what Cursor injects every turn. On fork `main` / `local/ops`
  it contains the upstream pointer to `CLAUDE.md` plus a fork-only section. Read the
  whole file.
- Branch layout: `docs/fork/README.md`.
- Do not put fork-only notes into a pull request. Upstream PRs open from
  `feat/qymcad-drive`, where root `AGENTS.md` must stay identical to upstream
  (short pointer only). Never open the PR from fork `main` or `local/ops`.
- Product coding rules remain in `CLAUDE.md`.
